    "about_video_description": "Luther Aloud is a YouTube channel that narrates Martin Luther's works — one work per episode, in the order he wrote them, from the Ninety-Five Theses of 1517 through the sermons, commentaries, and letters of his last years. The video is a still cover with the narration playing over it; the audio is the point, the picture is a frame.",
